  userData: "Created with built-in ImageGen. Prompt: Use case: logo-brand. Asset type: One small raster UI icon for a cozy LO-FI Unity game's pencil-writing sound button.\nCreate a SINGLE simple pencil icon angled diagonally from lower-left nib to upper-right eraser. Use only warm ivory / cream shapes and strokes, a clear pointed wooden tip, a small graphite nib indicated by negative space, two restrained parallel shaft details and a rounded eraser cap. Match a family of calm minimalist cream-on-transparent sound icons. Clean flat vector-like raster drawing, bold consistent lines with rounded joins, immediately recognizable at 32 to 48 pixels. Center it in a square canvas with a balanced transparent margin.\nEverything outside the pencil silhouette and intentional cutouts is genuinely transparent alpha. No background square or circle, no paper, no hand, no letters, no extra objects, no grunge, no speckles, no texture, no glow, no shadow cloud, no gradients, no watermark. This is a finished transparent PNG game icon, not a mockup or an illustration of a room."
